1
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:08,800
[Jinwoo walks up to Seungho,
who's sitting in the yard alone]

2
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:11,060
[Jinwoo: Honestly, I didn't even know
he was out there alone.]

3
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,660
[Jinwoo: I thought he went to the annex.]

4
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:14,140
[Jinwoo: Because Seungho]

5
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:16,810
[Jinwoo: gets along well with the people there.]

6
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:20,280
[Jinwoo: Plus, he just went on a date with Yongkyu.]

7
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:22,420
[Jinwoo: So I figured he was hanging out
with them in the annex.]

8
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:25,350
[Jinwoo: I had no idea he was sitting by himself.]

9
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:29,660
[Seungho: A lot was bugging me,
but I didn't feel like talking about it.]

10
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:32,290
[Seungho: Staying indoors felt suffocating.]

11
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:33,900
[Seungho: My mind was all over the place.]

12
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,820
[Jinwoo: What are you doing out here?]
[Seungho: Huh?]

13
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:40,220
[Jinwoo: You seem off.]

14
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,890
[Seungho: No, I'm just tired.]
[Jinwoo: Just tired?]

15
00:00:42,890 --> 00:00:46,630
[Jinwoo: You looked pretty upset.]

16
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:49,030
[Jinwoo: Did something happen?]

17
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:51,970
[Jinwoo: Is there something you wanna tell me?]

18
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:53,570
[Seungho: Nothing in particular.]

19
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:57,040
[Jinwoo: Did I mess up? Did I do something wrong?]

20
00:00:59,710 --> 00:01:01,580
[Seungho: No, it's just...]

21
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:03,980
[Seungho: Maybe you did.]

22
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:06,110
[Seungho: I don't really want to talk about it.]

23
00:01:06,110 --> 00:01:08,780
[Jinwoo: Just tell me one thing then.]

24
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:11,190
[Jinwoo: When did you start feeling upset?]

25
00:01:11,190 --> 00:01:12,789
[Seungho: Today.]

26
00:01:12,789 --> 00:01:15,720
[Jinwoo: What time today?]
[Seungho: Today.]

27
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:20,380
[Jinwoo: Is it because I kept talking to Heejin?]
[Seungho: You think so?]

28
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:22,130
[Jinwoo: Alright.]

29
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:26,130
[Jinwoo: Look, the reason I'm asking is]

30
00:01:26,130 --> 00:01:28,270
[Jinwoo: I genuinely have no clue.]

31
00:01:28,270 --> 00:01:29,870
[Jinwoo: I don't get why you're upset.]

32
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:37,350
[Seungho still doesn't want to answer]

33
00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:42,950
[Jinwoo: Honestly, after that phone call
with you earlier,]

34
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:46,150
[Jinwoo: I was pretty upset, too.]

35
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:47,490
[Seungho: Why?]

36
00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:50,430
[Jinwoo: When I called you, I was literally just]

37
00:01:50,430 --> 00:01:53,360
[Jinwoo: passing along the mission we got.]

38
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:57,370
[Jinwoo: But you went,
"Why are you calling me?"]

39
00:01:57,370 --> 00:02:00,300
[Jinwoo: And said, "I'd rather not even know
about the mission."]

40
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:04,570
[Jinwoo: You made it sound like
I was putting you in such a tough spot.]

41
00:02:04,570 --> 00:02:06,440
[Jinwoo: It felt like you kind of
threw me under the bus.]

42
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:10,979
[Jinwoo: So yeah, I was upset back then, too.]
[Seungho: Fair enough.]

43
00:02:11,510 --> 00:02:13,920
[Seungho: He suddenly started talking]

44
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,520
[Seungho: about what was bothering him.]

45
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,650
[Seungho: I was the one who brought up
my feelings first,]

46
00:02:17,650 --> 00:02:21,920
[Seungho: so why did he suddenly
start talking about what was bothering him?]

47
00:02:22,190 --> 00:02:25,930
[Seungho: I didn't fully get
what was happening that time.]

48
00:02:25,930 --> 00:02:27,800
[Seungho: Even if I hadn't come back,]

49
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:31,270
[Seungho: I didn't think it'd hurt you.
I still feel that way.]

50
00:02:31,270 --> 00:02:33,670
[Seungho: Even if I didn't come back]

51
00:02:33,670 --> 00:02:35,800
[Seungho: and stayed there,]

52
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:39,270
[Seungho: it's not like I was
that into Yongkyu anyway.
You know that, right?]

53
00:02:39,270 --> 00:02:40,070
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

54
00:02:40,070 --> 00:02:43,280
[Seungho: But if I chose to come back,
Yongkyu might have been really bummed out.]

55
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,880
[Seungho: So I just needed time]

56
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:46,480
[Seungho: to think it through.]

57
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:48,620
[Seungho: That's all I was trying to say back then.]

58
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:58,490
[Jinwoo: Heejin is in there.]
[Eunchae: Huh?]

59
00:02:58,490 --> 00:02:59,940
[Eunchae: Really? So what?]

60
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:01,580
[Jinwoo: Aren't you going over?]

61
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:03,380
[Shy]

62
00:03:03,380 --> 00:03:05,170
[Eunchae: Oh, come on, seriously.]

63
00:03:05,170 --> 00:03:07,570
[Jinwoo: Ah, what's wrong?
I was just letting you know.]

64
00:03:07,570 --> 00:03:09,970
[Eunchae: Ah, this is so embarrassing... OK.]

65
00:03:09,970 --> 00:03:12,110
[Huh?]
[Jinwoo: I saw you peeking over there.]

66
00:03:12,110 --> 00:03:16,640
[Eunchae: I was not sneaking peeks.
I literally just came out.]

67
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:18,510
[Heejin: What are you doing?]

68
00:03:18,510 --> 00:03:22,780
[Jinwoo: Ah, man, I'm losing my mind.]

69
00:03:22,780 --> 00:03:25,990
[Eunchae: Ah, wait, I don't know.]

70
00:03:25,990 --> 00:03:29,720
[Eunchae: Why did you come out?]
[Jinwoo: I wanted to talk to him.]

71
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:33,730
[Eunchae gets it and walks away immediately]

72
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:37,470
[Heejin goes out to look for Eunchae]

73
00:03:37,700 --> 00:03:40,940
[Heejin: What's up?]
[Jinwoo: Nah, right now... um...]

74
00:03:42,980 --> 00:03:47,180
[Seungho: I get why that upset you,]

75
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:51,980
[Seungho: but try putting yourself in my shoes.]

76
00:03:51,980 --> 00:03:55,450
[Seungho: I feel like you could have been
a bit more tactful when talking to me.]

77
00:03:56,340 --> 00:04:01,060
[Seungho: Honestly, if it were Hyeyeon,
she would've gotten where I was coming from.]

78
00:04:01,060 --> 00:04:02,860
[Jinwoo: Mm...]

79
00:04:04,260 --> 00:04:07,340
[Seungho: The reason I brought up
Hyeyeon right in front of him]

80
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:09,620
[Seungho: was that at that moment,
I was frustrated, too.]

81
00:04:09,620 --> 00:04:12,800
[Seungho: I kind of wanted]

82
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,140
[Seungho: to push his buttons a little.]

83
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:16,800
[Seungho: I felt like saying that]

84
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:19,740
[Seungho: might actually pull]

85
00:04:19,740 --> 00:04:22,680
[Seungho: a real reaction out of him.]

86
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:26,680
[Jinwoo: And another thing,
you keep bringing up Hyeyeon]

87
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:29,350
[Jinwoo: and comparing her to me.]

88
00:04:29,350 --> 00:04:30,690
[Jinwoo: You're having a conversation
with me, right?]

89
00:04:30,690 --> 00:04:32,550
[Jinwoo: I don't get why you keep bringing her up.]

90
00:04:32,550 --> 00:04:34,690
[Jinwoo: I've been wondering
about this since yesterday.]

91
00:04:36,290 --> 00:04:40,580
[Seungho: Right now, I have feelings
for both of you.]
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

92
00:04:40,580 --> 00:04:43,380
[Seungho: But something happened
that upset me today.]

93
00:04:43,380 --> 00:04:44,980
[Seungho: You said you like me,]

94
00:04:44,980 --> 00:04:46,850
[Seungho: and she said she likes me, too.]

95
00:04:46,850 --> 00:04:49,250
[Seungho: So of course I'm going to compare.]

96
00:04:49,250 --> 00:04:50,850
[Seungho: If it were Hyeyeon, she wouldn't
have handled it the way you did.]

97
00:04:50,850 --> 00:04:52,990
[Seungho: I'm just trying to make that point.]

98
00:04:52,990 --> 00:04:54,590
[Jinwoo: I know that was just a pointless jab.]

99
00:04:54,590 --> 00:04:56,720
[Seungho: It wasn't a pointless jab.]
[Jinwoo: What was it then?]

100
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,330
[Seungho: Just stating facts.]

101
00:04:58,330 --> 00:04:59,930
[Seungho: It wasn't meaningless at all.]

102
00:04:59,930 --> 00:05:03,130
[Seungho: Plus, I don't think
it was something I shouldn't say.]

103
00:05:03,130 --> 00:05:06,330
[Seungho: Isn't it actually better
that I'm being upfront about it?]

104
00:05:06,870 --> 00:05:07,940
[Jinwoo: Even if you didn't say it,]

105
00:05:07,940 --> 00:05:12,210
[Jinwoo: I knew
how Hyeyeon felt about you.]

106
00:05:12,210 --> 00:05:14,340
[Jinwoo: Honestly, I didn't expect us
to sit on that bench]

107
00:05:14,340 --> 00:05:17,550
[Jinwoo: and have such a heated,
emotional conversation.]

108
00:05:17,550 --> 00:05:21,550
[Jinwoo: I think we both surprised each other]

109
00:05:21,550 --> 00:05:22,620
[Jinwoo: when we finally
got everything off our chests.]

110
00:05:24,060 --> 00:05:27,100
[Jinwoo: Is there anything else you wanna say?]

111
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:30,300
[Seungho: Didn't you just ask me why I was upset?]
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

112
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:34,040
[Seungho: It was also the way you talk to me.]

113
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,370
[Jinwoo: Me? To you?]

114
00:05:35,900 --> 00:05:38,570
[Seungho: First of all, every time you talk to me,
it's always "Hey, you..."]
[Note: He is speaking in banmal.]

115
00:05:38,570 --> 00:05:40,300
[Seungho: I don't like that.]

116
00:05:40,340 --> 00:05:41,300
[Ah...]

117
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:43,940
[Ah...]
[Seungho: Other people usually call me by my name.]

118
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:46,340
[Seungho: But you constantly say "you, you, you,"
and I don't like it.]

119
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:47,409
[Jinwoo: I see.]
[Seungho: And another thing...]

120
00:05:47,409 --> 00:05:49,550
[Seungho: Earlier, you were messaging Eunchae]

121
00:05:49,550 --> 00:05:50,880
[Seungho: on SBM Talk.]

122
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:52,480
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]
[Seungho: And then...]

123
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:55,780
[Seungho: I casually said, "Let me send it for you.
Give me your phone."]

124
00:05:55,780 --> 00:05:57,100
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]
[Seungho: I don't know if you remember.]

125
00:05:57,100 --> 00:05:57,700
[Jinwoo: I remember.]
[Seungho: I don't know if you remember...]

126
00:05:58,090 --> 00:06:00,140
[Let me send it for you]

127
00:06:00,140 --> 00:06:01,700
[Let me send it for you]
[Never mind]

128
00:06:01,740 --> 00:06:03,380
[Embarrassed]

129
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,320
Then when is she coming back?

130
00:06:05,830 --> 00:06:09,570
[Seungho feels so embarrassed
he hides under the blanket]

131
00:06:07,380 --> 00:06:08,440
Then when is she...

132
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:13,340
[Ah...]
[Seungho: I was just joking around.
Why did you brush me off so coldly?]

133
00:06:13,340 --> 00:06:16,550
[Seungho: That really hurt my feelings.]

134
00:06:16,550 --> 00:06:19,480
[Jinwoo: First off, I'm really sorry
for talking like that.]

135
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:22,950
[Jinwoo: I'll try not to do that anymore.]

136
00:06:22,950 --> 00:06:24,820
[Jinwoo: Honestly,]

137
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:28,830
[Jinwoo: before you brought it up,
I didn't even realize I was doing it.]

138
00:06:29,420 --> 00:06:32,030
[Jinwoo: I'm really sorry about that.]

139
00:06:32,030 --> 00:06:33,630
[Jinwoo: I wasn't even aware I was doing it.]

140
00:06:33,630 --> 00:06:37,900
[Jinwoo: If that hurt you...
ah, if that bothered you,]

141
00:06:37,900 --> 00:06:39,500
[Jinwoo: I apologize.]

142
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:44,310
[Jinwoo: Since we're finally getting
a chance to talk things out,]

143
00:06:44,310 --> 00:06:48,050
[Jinwoo: I've got... one more thing to say.]

144
00:06:48,050 --> 00:06:50,180
[Jinwoo: Remember when I asked you before,]

145
00:06:50,180 --> 00:06:56,050
[Jinwoo: if we ended up together
and I still couldn't quit smoking,]

146
00:06:56,050 --> 00:06:58,720
[Jinwoo: whether you'd be totally turned off
and disappointed in me?]

147
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,330
[Jinwoo: Back then, you said, "Of course I would."]

148
00:07:00,330 --> 00:07:04,060
[Jinwoo: If we actually became a couple
and I kept smoking,]

149
00:07:04,060 --> 00:07:07,270
[Jinwoo: it'd just be an empty promise.]

150
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:10,470
[Jinwoo: It's been weighing on my mind.]

151
00:07:10,470 --> 00:07:13,140
[Jinwoo: I want to be straight
with you about how I really feel.]

152
00:07:13,140 --> 00:07:16,070
[Jinwoo: Yeah... so...]
[Seungho: So,]

153
00:07:16,070 --> 00:07:18,480
[Seungho: quitting smoking is just too hard for you.]

154
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:21,410
[Seungho: You made that promise on impulse.]

155
00:07:21,410 --> 00:07:25,150
[Seungho: And even if we become a couple,
you'll probably keep smoking.]

156
00:07:25,150 --> 00:07:30,100
[Seungho: So you want to take back
the promise you can't keep, right?]

157
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:31,460
[Jinwoo: I'll try to quit...]

158
00:07:31,460 --> 00:07:32,890
[Jinwoo: That's actually what I meant to say.]

159
00:07:32,890 --> 00:07:36,090
[Jinwoo: I wanted to bring this up yesterday too,
but you were so...]

160
00:07:36,090 --> 00:07:39,300
[Jinwoo: you were so firm about
saying you'd be deeply disappointed.]

161
00:07:39,300 --> 00:07:41,970
[Jinwoo: You said if I couldn't keep it,
I shouldn't promise it. Hearing you say that,]

162
00:07:41,970 --> 00:07:43,620
[Jinwoo: it was even harder for me to bring it up.]

163
00:07:43,620 --> 00:07:47,890
[Jinwoo: So I couldn't just let it slide.]

164
00:07:47,890 --> 00:07:49,220
[Jinwoo: But it still kept bugging me.]

165
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:53,230
[Jinwoo: I've been wanting to be honest with you.]
[Seungho: Yeah.]

166
00:07:53,230 --> 00:07:56,700
[Jinwoo: I don't regret saying]

167
00:07:56,700 --> 00:08:00,440
[Jinwoo: those things to you.]

168
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:02,570
[Jinwoo: I really hate lying.]

169
00:08:02,570 --> 00:08:04,710
[Jinwoo: I just wanted to be real with him.]

170
00:08:04,710 --> 00:08:06,840
[Jinwoo: I've always felt like I was the one
accommodating him]

171
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:08,710
[Jinwoo: and looking out for him.]

172
00:08:08,710 --> 00:08:10,580
[Jinwoo: But I can't keep doing that forever.]

173
00:08:10,580 --> 00:08:14,320
[Jinwoo: So I ended up getting a little petty.]

174
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:16,450
[Jinwoo: I said some pretty harsh things.]

175
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:22,380
[Jinwoo: I've always been all-in on you.]

176
00:08:22,380 --> 00:08:26,650
[Jinwoo: I never wavered.]

177
00:08:26,650 --> 00:08:30,660
[Jinwoo: But my feelings started to waver today.]

178
00:08:30,660 --> 00:08:32,530
[Jinwoo: My feelings for you.]

179
00:08:33,460 --> 00:08:35,820
[Seungho: Me too.]

180
00:08:35,860 --> 00:08:37,460
[Seungho: Now I know where his head is at,]

181
00:08:37,460 --> 00:08:40,390
[Seungho: and I kind of see
what kind of person he is now.]

182
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:43,330
[Seungho: We really don't click at all.
We probably never will.]

183
00:08:43,330 --> 00:08:45,200
[Seungho: Maybe this is]

184
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,800
[Seungho: the exact push I needed
to completely give up on him.]

185
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:51,610
[Seungho: Honestly, if we didn't clash today,
we would've tomorrow.]

186
00:08:51,610 --> 00:08:54,810
[Seungho: This kind of conflict was bound to happen.]

187
00:08:54,810 --> 00:08:57,480
[Seungho: So maybe it's actually for the best.]

188
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:59,350
[Jinwoo: Got anything else to say?]

189
00:08:59,350 --> 00:09:03,620
[Seungho: Nope. We're done here.]

190
00:09:03,620 --> 00:09:04,950
[Jinwoo: Let's head inside then.]

191
00:09:05,750 --> 00:09:07,620
[Jinwoo: You came out here to go
for a solo walk, right?]

192
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:09,620
[Jinwoo: To get some fresh air?]

193
00:09:09,620 --> 00:09:10,940
[Seungho: I've been out long enough. It's freezing.]
[Jinwoo: Have you?]

194
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:15,100
[Jinwoo: Alright, let's head in.]

195
00:09:15,100 --> 00:09:16,960
[Jinwoo: Did I really need to go that far?]

196
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,900
[Jinwoo: He might take what I said the wrong way,]

197
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:22,570
[Jinwoo:  because I usually never speak like that.]

198
00:09:22,570 --> 00:09:25,510
[Jinwoo: It was my first time
ever saying things like that, too.]

199
00:09:25,510 --> 00:09:28,440
[Jinwoo: It probably caught him off guard.]

200
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:31,650
[Jinwoo: But I felt like I had
to lay it all out eventually.]

201
00:09:31,650 --> 00:09:35,120
[Jinwoo: I just regret
that I couldn't put it a bit more gently.]

202
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:40,190
[A crack appeared in
what had seemed like a smooth relationship]

203
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:49,260
[Seungho: Well,]

204
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:52,470
[Seungho: it's just that his passion
for me has cooled down, right?]

205
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:55,940
[Seungho: If he really liked me,]

206
00:09:55,940 --> 00:10:00,210
[Seungho: I feel like he would've
done those things for me.]

207
00:10:00,740 --> 00:10:06,880
[Can Seungho and Jinwoo fix what's broken?]

208
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,780
[Heejin: Did you take care of...]
[Eunchae: Huh?]

209
00:10:11,780 --> 00:10:14,220
[Heejin: that urgent thing? Is it done?]
[Eunchae: Yeah.]

210
00:10:14,220 --> 00:10:16,060
[Eunchae: Do you wanna talk?]

211
00:10:16,060 --> 00:10:17,180
[Heejin: What?]
[Eunchae: Do you wanna talk?]

212
00:10:17,180 --> 00:10:17,900
[Heejin: Yeah.]
[Eunchae: Do you wanna talk?]

213
00:10:17,900 --> 00:10:19,420
