[Jinwoo: and he saw me texting you on SBM Talk.]

435
00:20:57,210 --> 00:21:00,410
[Jinwoo: He went, "I wanna see your SBM Talk,"]

436
00:21:00,410 --> 00:21:02,020
[Jinwoo: and tried to grab my phone.]

437
00:21:02,020 --> 00:21:04,950
[Jinwoo: I brushed him off, saying, "No, never mind,"
and pulled my phone back.]

438
00:21:04,950 --> 00:21:08,160
[Jinwoo: Then Seungho suddenly...]

439
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:10,290
[Jinwoo: He was like, "I was just joking around,]

440
00:21:10,290 --> 00:21:14,830
[Jinwoo: but why did you snap at me with "Never mind"
and snatch the phone away?"]

441
00:21:14,830 --> 00:21:17,230
[Jinwoo: He said he wasn't even actually gonna snoop...]

442
00:21:17,230 --> 00:21:19,370
[Eunchae: Yeah, why would he actually snoop?]
[Jinwoo: He wasn't gonna snoop,]

443
00:21:19,370 --> 00:21:23,900
[Jinwoo: but me snatching the phone back like that]

444
00:21:23,900 --> 00:21:27,910
[Jinwoo: made him feel pretty hurt.]

445
00:21:27,910 --> 00:21:30,040
[Jinwoo: I apologized to him about that part.]

446
00:21:30,040 --> 00:21:32,710
[Jinwoo: Since we were clearing the air anyway,]

447
00:21:32,710 --> 00:21:37,780
[Jinwoo: I told him about how I was upset]

448
00:21:37,780 --> 00:21:41,250
[Jinwoo: about the way he talked to me
on the phone.]

449
00:21:41,250 --> 00:21:45,530
[Jinwoo: At the end, I brought up
the smoking thing, too.]

450
00:21:45,530 --> 00:21:51,400
[Jinwoo: After I said all that...
he didn't take it well.]

451
00:21:53,270 --> 00:21:58,610
[Seungho is on the second floor,
overhearing Jinwoo's conversation]

452
00:21:58,610 --> 00:22:02,340
[Eunchae: How do I put this...]

453
00:22:02,340 --> 00:22:05,280
[Heejin: Are you guys still talking?
When are you coming back to the room?]
[Jinwoo: What's up? What's wrong?]

454
00:22:05,280 --> 00:22:09,280
[Heejin: Wrap it up quick
so we can wash up and sleep.]

455
00:22:10,080 --> 00:22:13,020
[Heejin: Hey, tell me the whole story in detail.]

456
00:22:13,020 --> 00:22:14,350
[Jinwoo: In detail?]
[Heejin: Aren't you gonna spill?]

457
00:22:14,350 --> 00:22:16,220
[Jinwoo: Nah, I don't mind, I can lay it all out.]

458
00:22:15,820 --> 00:22:16,220
Spill it then.

459
00:22:16,220 --> 00:22:18,090
[Jinwoo: First off, we...]

460
00:22:18,090 --> 00:22:19,430
[Jinwoo: Remember what I told you earlier]

461
00:22:19,430 --> 00:22:22,360
[Jinwoo: about why he was angry?]

462
00:22:22,360 --> 00:22:23,960
[Jinwoo: Our guesses were totally off.]
[Heejin: What was it then?]

463
00:22:23,960 --> 00:22:26,100
[Jinwoo: He told me]

464
00:22:26,100 --> 00:22:27,700
[Jinwoo: there were two reasons.]

465
00:22:27,700 --> 00:22:29,570
[Jinwoo: There were two reasons. Number one,]

466
00:22:29,570 --> 00:22:31,170
[Jinwoo: I was being way too casual with Seungho.]

467
00:22:31,170 --> 00:22:31,970
[Jinwoo: Subconsciously,]

468
00:22:31,970 --> 00:22:35,180
[Jinwoo: I kept calling him "you" all the time.]

469
00:22:35,180 --> 00:22:39,180
[Jinwoo: He was upset about that.]

470
00:22:39,180 --> 00:22:42,380
[Jinwoo: And the second reason was,
earlier when I was messaging]

471
00:22:42,380 --> 00:22:44,790
[Jinwoo: Eunchae on SBM Talk, Seungho said,]

472
00:22:44,790 --> 00:22:47,450
[Jinwoo: "I wanna see it, too. Let me send it."]

473
00:22:47,450 --> 00:22:50,660
[Jinwoo: I told him, "Never mind,"
and grabbed my phone away.]

474
00:22:50,660 --> 00:22:53,330
[Jinwoo: Seungho thought,]

475
00:22:53,330 --> 00:22:55,730
[Jinwoo: "I was just messing around like usual.]

476
00:22:55,730 --> 00:23:00,000
[Jinwoo: It's not like I'll
snoop through your phone.]

477
00:23:00,060 --> 00:23:02,140
[Turn head]

478
00:23:02,180 --> 00:23:05,780
[Turn head] [Turn head]
[Jinwoo: Why would you..."]

479
00:23:06,140 --> 00:23:09,420
[One step] [One step]

480
00:23:09,420 --> 00:23:11,460
[Startled]

481
00:23:17,620 --> 00:23:19,490
[Jinwoo: I... I thought you were asleep.]

482
00:23:19,490 --> 00:23:21,890
[Heejin: Can't sleep? Trouble falling asleep?]
[Seungho: Yeah, doesn't feel like I can sleep.]

483
00:23:21,890 --> 00:23:23,900
[Jinwoo: Come hang out then.]
[Heejin: Why don't you sit with us for a bit?]

484
00:23:23,900 --> 00:23:25,940
[Jinwoo: We couldn't sleep, either,
so we're here to chat.]
[Heejin: Take a seat.]

485
00:23:25,940 --> 00:23:27,860
[Seungho: You're literally airing out
everything I said.]

486
00:23:26,330 --> 00:23:27,080
-You're literally airing out -Sit right there.

487
00:23:27,080 --> 00:23:27,860
everything I said.

488
00:23:27,860 --> 00:23:28,820
[Seungho: I could hear you clearly from upstairs.]

489
00:23:28,860 --> 00:23:31,060
[Freeze]

490
00:23:31,500 --> 00:23:35,500
[Heejin: It shows that he's really troubled.]

491
00:23:35,500 --> 00:23:38,170
[Heejin: So it's understandable.]

492
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:41,640
[Heejin: It means you're important to him.]

493
00:23:43,380 --> 00:23:46,740
[Nod]

494
00:23:54,450 --> 00:23:55,520
[Seungho: I heard every single word.]

495
00:23:55,520 --> 00:23:57,940
[Jinwoo: Ah, really?]
[Seungho: It honestly made me laugh.]

496
00:23:57,980 --> 00:23:59,500
[Ah...]

497
00:23:59,500 --> 00:24:01,130
[Eunchae: While I was listening to him,
I kept thinking,]

498
00:24:01,130 --> 00:24:04,900
[Eunchae: "Is he really gonna spill all this
in his normal voice?]

499
00:24:04,900 --> 00:24:06,860
[Didn't I tell you to keep it down?]

500
00:24:06,900 --> 00:24:08,600
[Eunchae: Is this really OK?]

501
00:24:08,600 --> 00:24:11,540
[Eunchae: Or is he doing this on purpose?"]

502
00:24:11,540 --> 00:24:13,940
[Seungho: At first, I only caught bits and pieces.]

503
00:24:13,940 --> 00:24:16,880
[Seungho: But as I kept listening, every word
came through crystal clear.]

504
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:18,750
[Jinwoo: I wasn't trying to let you eavesdrop.]

505
00:24:18,750 --> 00:24:21,420
[Heejin: Yeah, exactly.]
[Jinwoo: I was just so lost,]

506
00:24:21,420 --> 00:24:24,080
[Jinwoo: so I was basically asking her for advice.]
[Heejin: Really.]

507
00:24:24,080 --> 00:24:26,490
[Seungho: You laid out every single detail.]

508
00:24:26,490 --> 00:24:27,820
[Jinwoo: Rather than stressing over it alone,]

509
00:24:27,820 --> 00:24:29,960
[Jinwoo: I wanted to get
someone else's perspective.]

510
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:33,430
[Heejin: So did you guys end up
having a good talk?]

511
00:24:36,630 --> 00:24:39,030
[Jinwoo: We both shared our true feelings.]

512
00:24:39,030 --> 00:24:42,240
[Heejin: Since you both care
about each other so much,]

513
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:44,910
[Heejin: I think that's only natural.]

514
00:24:44,910 --> 00:24:49,710
[Heejin: Honestly, I see this as a sign
that your bond can grow even stronger.]

515
00:24:49,710 --> 00:24:52,110
[Heejin: I'm not just saying that to be nice.]

516
00:24:52,910 --> 00:24:55,050
[Heejin: Do I sound like an old-fashioned person?]
[Jinwoo: No way.]

517
00:24:55,050 --> 00:24:58,520
[Jinwoo: No, not at all.
I actually like hearing that.]

518
00:24:58,520 --> 00:25:00,390
[Heejin: I mean it.]

519
00:24:58,790 --> 00:24:59,720
I really mean it.

520
00:25:00,920 --> 00:25:04,120
[A day full of ups and downs]

521
00:25:04,120 --> 00:25:06,530
[Heejin: I'm heading in to shower first.]

522
00:25:11,060 --> 00:25:13,470
[Jinwoo: Night.]

523
00:25:13,470 --> 00:25:16,540
[Seungho: Good night.]
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

524
00:25:17,580 --> 00:25:20,620
[Turn head] [Turn head]

525
00:25:21,580 --> 00:25:22,810
[Jinwoo: What's up?]

526
00:25:22,810 --> 00:25:24,950
[Seungho: I noticed you staring at me.]

527
00:25:24,950 --> 00:25:28,150
[Jinwoo: I was just glancing over.]

528
00:25:31,080 --> 00:25:33,750
[Jinwoo: Honestly, I feel kind of bad
about Seungho.]

529
00:25:35,090 --> 00:25:37,760
[Jinwoo: Man, I'm gonna cry.]

530
00:25:37,760 --> 00:25:41,230
[Jinwoo: I just feel so bad for him.]

531
00:25:41,230 --> 00:25:43,100
[Jinwoo: He's still young, you know?]

532
00:25:43,100 --> 00:25:46,300
[Jinwoo: But I treated him like]

533
00:25:46,300 --> 00:25:48,170
[Jinwoo: he was my own age,]

534
00:25:48,170 --> 00:25:51,100
[Jinwoo: and I really regret doing that.]

535
00:25:51,100 --> 00:25:52,970
[Jinwoo: I let my emotions get the better of me.]

536
00:25:52,970 --> 00:25:57,510
[Jinwoo: I just ran my mouth
without putting myself in his shoes.]

537
00:25:57,510 --> 00:25:59,910
[Jinwoo: I feel terrible about it.]

538
00:26:00,860 --> 00:26:04,380
[Seungho: On Day 4, the person I had feelings for]

539
00:26:04,380 --> 00:26:06,250
[Seungho: went away for an overnight trip,
completely vanished.]

540
00:26:06,250 --> 00:26:10,250
[Seungho: And my other interest
got into a fight with me.]

541
00:26:10,250 --> 00:26:13,990
[Seungho: She didn't come back,
which bummed me out.]

542
00:26:13,990 --> 00:26:17,190
[Seungho: Sitting in all that awkwardness,]

543
00:26:17,190 --> 00:26:21,730
[Seungho: having Hyeyeon around
would've made things way less awkward.]

544
00:26:21,730 --> 00:26:24,130
[Seungho: I really hoped she'd come back.]

545
00:26:24,670 --> 00:26:28,670
[Where do Seungho and Jinwoo go from here?]

546
00:26:30,270 --> 00:26:31,880
[Yongkyu: Eunchae.]
[Eunchae: Yeah?]

547
00:26:31,880 --> 00:26:35,610
[Yongkyu: I'm curious where your head is at.]

548
00:26:35,610 --> 00:26:36,680
[Eunchae: Huh? What do you mean? About what?]

549
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:38,820
[Yongkyu: Who have you been talking to?]

550
00:26:38,820 --> 00:26:41,220
[Eunchae: I actually got a vote yesterday, right?]

551
00:26:41,220 --> 00:26:44,690
[Eunchae: Up until then, I always had zero votes.]

552
00:26:44,690 --> 00:26:46,820
[Eunchae: I don't know if you noticed.]

553
00:26:48,430 --> 00:26:49,760
[I think I figured it out.]

554
00:26:50,450 --> 00:26:52,560
-That's just how it goes. -I think I figured it out.

555
00:26:50,560 --> 00:26:52,620
[That's just how it goes.]

556
00:26:52,620 --> 00:26:55,370
[Eunchae: I wasn't sure if you knew
or picked up on it,]

557
00:26:55,370 --> 00:27:00,170
[Eunchae: but I really like them back.]

558
00:27:00,170 --> 00:27:02,040
[Is it Heejin?]

559
00:27:02,040 --> 00:27:03,740
[Eunchae: It's Heejin.]
[Yongkyu: Called it, right?]

560
00:27:03,740 --> 00:27:05,510
[Look, I knew it.]
[Eunchae: It's Heejin.]
[Yongkyu: Called it, right?]

561
00:27:07,380 --> 00:27:08,710
[Eunchae: Everything's gone crazy!]

562
00:27:08,710 --> 00:27:12,100
[Eunchae: We're halfway through the show now.]

563
00:27:12,100 --> 00:27:14,850
[Eunchae: Today really felt like
a massive turning point.]

564
00:27:14,850 --> 00:27:18,050
[Eunchae: It really lifted my spirits.]

565
00:27:18,050 --> 00:27:20,190
[Eunchae: Anyway, the fact
that I successfully matched]

566
00:27:20,190 --> 00:27:23,130
[Eunchae: with someone
and now have a clear person in mind…]

567
00:27:23,130 --> 00:27:28,200
[Eunchae: that alone makes me
feel a little relieved.]

568
00:27:28,730 --> 00:27:32,200
[Looking forward to Heejin and Eunchae tomorrow]

569
00:27:38,020 --> 00:27:42,820
[Nam-ae Guesthouse]

570
00:27:50,890 --> 00:27:53,820
[Sujin: Are you awake?]
[Hyeyeon: Yeah.]

571
00:27:53,820 --> 00:27:55,960
[Hyeyeon: Are you still sleepy?]
[Sujin: Yeah.]

572
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:57,830
[Hyeyeon: Go back to sleep then.]

573
00:27:58,940 --> 00:28:00,100
[Hyeyeon: It felt refreshing.]

574
00:28:00,100 --> 00:28:01,570
[Hyeyeon: When I opened my eyes,]

575
00:28:01,570 --> 00:28:04,500
[Hyeyeon: I was in a totally different place.]

576
00:28:04,500 --> 00:28:07,700
[Hyeyeon: It really felt like a trip.]

577
00:28:11,440 --> 00:28:14,110
[Checking on Seungho the second she wakes up]

578
00:28:14,640 --> 00:28:17,580
[Hyeyeon: But I wanna get back to the house ASAP]

579
00:28:17,580 --> 00:28:19,980
[Hyeyeon: and meet Seungho]

580
00:28:32,000 --> 00:28:36,270
[Hyeyeon rushing to get back to BI-LIVE]

581
00:28:36,800 --> 00:28:40,540
[And Sujin taking her sweet time getting ready]

582
00:28:43,210 --> 00:28:44,810
[Hyeyeon: You sleep so soundly.]

583
00:28:48,550 --> 00:28:50,950
[Hyeyeon: Oh, you're here.]
[Sujin: Mind if I squeeze in next to you?]

584
00:28:50,950 --> 00:28:52,020
[Hyeyeon: Sure.]

585
00:28:52,550 --> 00:28:56,550
[Sujin: Even though I spent two days
and one night with Hyeyeon,]

586
00:28:56,550 --> 00:28:58,960
[Sujin: my feelings for her didn't really grow.]

587
00:28:59,220 --> 00:29:00,820
[Sujin: Honestly, nothing much changed.]

588
00:29:01,360 --> 00:29:03,490
[Sujin: How long have you been getting ready?]

589
00:29:03,490 --> 00:29:07,760
[Sujin: I'm good to go.
I just need to throw on some clothes.]

590
00:29:07,760 --> 00:29:09,370
[Hyeyeon: Same here.]

591
00:29:10,170 --> 00:29:12,300
[Sujin: Wanna head downstairs
and grab a nice meal?]

592
00:29:12,300 --> 00:29:13,900
[Hyeyeon: Let's get some breakfast.]

593
00:29:13,900 --> 00:29:15,510
[Sujin: Sounds good.]

594
00:29:18,710 --> 00:29:20,310
[Hyeyeon: Hey.]

595
00:29:20,310 --> 00:29:21,380
[Sujin: Oh, hey.]

596
00:29:21,380 --> 00:29:22,710
[Hyeyeon: Did you have fun today?]

597
00:29:22,710 --> 00:29:25,380
[Sujin: Yeah, I had a great time.]
[Hyeyeon: Ah, nice.]

598
00:29:25,380 --> 00:29:26,720
[Sujin: How about you?]

599
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:29,120
[Hyeyeon: I had a blast, too.]

600
00:29:29,120 --> 00:29:30,990
[Hyeyeon: Enjoy.]
[Sujin: Ah, okay, okay.]

601
00:29:36,590 --> 00:29:38,730
[Hyeyeon: I wonder what everyone]

602
00:29:39,260 --> 00:29:40,860
[Hyeyeon: at BI-LIVE is up to right now.]

603
00:29:40,860 --> 00:29:42,470
[Hyeyeon: But since we're still stuck out here,]

604
00:29:42,470 --> 00:29:45,940
[Hyeyeon: they wouldn't start
pairing people up again, would they?]
[Sujin: Nah.]

605
00:29:45,940 --> 00:29:48,340
[Sujin: They're probably making breakfast, right?]

606
00:29:48,340 --> 00:29:49,410
[Hyeyeon: Could be.]

607
00:29:49,410 --> 00:29:52,080
[Hyeyeon: I mean, they wake up pretty late anyway...]

608
00:29:54,740 --> 00:29:57,150
[Meanwhile, back at BI-LIVE...]

609
00:29:57,860 --> 00:30:00,900
[Hyeyeon, Heejin, Seungho, Jinwoo]

610
00:30:03,290 --> 00:30:04,350
[Heejin: Did you sleep well?]

611
00:30:04,350 --> 00:30:07,820
[Seungho: Yeah, slept great.]
[Heejin: Really?]

612
00:30:07,820 --> 00:30:09,160
[Seungho: I passed out the second
my head hit the pillow.]

613
00:30:09,160 --> 00:30:11,030
[Heejin: Yeah, total knockout.]

614
00:30:12,630 --> 00:30:15,570
[Jinwoo walks out, already washed up]

615
00:30:15,570 --> 00:30:17,170
[Heejin: Should we turn on the light in here?]

616
00:30:17,170 --> 00:30:18,500
[Jinwoo: Ah, sure.]

617
00:30:18,500 --> 00:30:19,840
[Heejin: Thanks.]

618
00:30:21,440 --> 00:30:22,240
[Jinwoo: Sleep well?]

619
00:30:22,500 --> 00:30:23,980
[Ice-cold]

620
00:30:24,370 --> 00:30:25,980
[Seungho: When I woke up this morning,]

621
00:30:25,980 --> 00:30:27,310
[Seungho: I felt even angrier.]

622
00:30:27,310 --> 00:30:31,050
[Seungho: Nothing got resolved.
The frustration just kept building up.]

623
00:30:31,050 --> 00:30:33,180
[Seungho: I felt like Jinwoo]

624
00:30:33,180 --> 00:30:35,590
[Seungho: acted all unbothered on the surface,]

625
00:30:35,590 --> 00:30:39,320
[Seungho: but he kept dwelling on it.]

626
00:30:39,860 --> 00:30:42,530
[Jinwoo: This might just be my take,]

627
00:30:42,530 --> 00:30:44,390
[Jinwoo: but the air felt super heavy.]

628
00:30:44,390 --> 00:30:47,600
[Jinwoo: I'm usually pretty level-headed.]

629
00:30:47,600 --> 00:30:51,330
[Jinwoo: Looking back on my life,
you could say it's been quite a winding road. ]

630
00:30:51,330 --> 00:30:53,200
[Jinwoo: I've been through a lot of things,]

631
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:55,610
[Jinwoo: and I've faced plenty
of ups and downs in relationships, too.]

632
00:30:55,610 --> 00:30:59,880
[Jinwoo: Things like this normally]

633
00:30:59,880 --> 00:31:02,550
[Jinwoo: don't shake me.]

634
00:31:02,550 --> 00:31:06,020
[Jinwoo: But in BI-LIVE… Something just feels off.]

635
00:31:07,080 --> 00:31:09,750
[Heejin stuck between Seungho
and Jinwoo's icy tension]

636
00:31:10,820 --> 00:31:14,560
[Heejin: I kept telling myself I have
to date Eunchae tomorrow,]

637
00:31:14,560 --> 00:31:16,160
[Heejin: so I fell asleep in such a good mood.]

638
00:31:16,160 --> 00:31:19,100
[Heejin: Plus, my skin needs to look flawless,]

639
00:31:19,100 --> 00:31:21,380
[Heejin: so I even did a full Gua Sha routine.]

640
00:31:22,420 --> 00:31:27,380
[ROOM: Tae Eunchae, Lim Chaebe, Koo Yongkyu]

641
00:31:27,900 --> 00:31:30,840
[Another busy morning in the 3-person room]

642
00:31:31,370 --> 00:31:33,240
[Chaebe: You ready?]

643
00:31:31,580 --> 00:31:33,000
-You ready? -Yeah.

644
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:33,240
-You ready?

645
00:31:33,240 --> 00:31:34,840
[Yongkyu: Just drying my hair.]

646
00:31:34,840 --> 00:31:36,980
[Yongkyu: You should do your hair, too.]

647
00:31:37,250 --> 00:31:38,580
[Chaebe: Did Eunchae's phone]

648
00:31:38,580 --> 00:31:40,720
[Chaebe: go off around 8 AM earlier?]

649
00:31:40,720 --> 00:31:43,920
[Eunchae: I don't know. Did I set an 8 AM alarm?]
[Chaebe: Yeah, it was super loud.]

650
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:45,790
[Eunchae: 8 AM? That wasn't my alarm.]

651
00:31:45,790 --> 00:31:47,120
[Chaebe: Did no one wake up to that?]

652
00:31:47,120 --> 00:31:48,990
[Eunchae: I didn't set an alarm for 8 AM.]

653
00:31:48,990 --> 00:31:50,060
[Yongkyu: I turned it off.]

654
